abstract: >-
  A study of the real Clifford algebra Cl(3,3) of the split space R^{3,3} and its graded tower Cl(3n,3n): which ingredients of
  relativistic field theory the algebra fixes, which it admits and which it obstructs, with a complete computational verification package.
  Version 1.0.0, preprint, not peer reviewed. Manuscript and documentation under CC BY 4.0; verification software under MIT
  (see LICENSE.md).
